{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Setting up App Attest","modules":[{"name":"NoughtyTours SDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK authenticates ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"itself"}]},{"text":". Every capture and data request is authorized by a bearer the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SDK mints from an Apple App Attest assertion, scoped to the organisation you tell it about. That","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"means the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"device","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is attested against ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"your"}]},{"text":" App ID — which is why this part cannot be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pre-configured for you, and why the SDK carries no key of its own.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Four steps, in order. Skip any of them and device auth fails with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/NoughtyToursError\/auth(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"1. Get registered","anchor":"1-Get-registered"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Send us your app’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"bundle identifier","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Team ID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". You get back a "},{"code":"pk_ios_*","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" publishable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key per environment. The key is publishable — it ships in your binary — but it is bound to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"App ID and Team we register for App Attest."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Questions, a key, or a backend registration: "},{"identifier":"mailto:info@thenoughtyfox.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"2. Enable the App Attest capability","anchor":"2-Enable-the-App-Attest-capability"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Attest"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" capability to your app target (Signing & Capabilities), or enable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"DeviceCheck \/ App Attest on the App ID in the developer portal. Regenerate provisioning profiles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"afterwards."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"3. Set the App Attest environment entitlement","anchor":"3-Set-the-App-Attest-environment-entitlement"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"xml","code":["<key>com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment<\/key>","<string>development<\/string>"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"type":"text","text":" uses Apple’s App Attest "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"sandbox","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"production"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the production service. Keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"created in one do not work in the other."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apple ignores this entitlement once you distribute. Builds delivered through","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TestFlight, the App Store, or the Enterprise Program always attest against the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"production"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"environment, whatever the entitlement says. Only locally-signed development builds honour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"anchor":"4-Match-the-environment-to-the-key","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"4. Match the environment to the key"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Configuration\/environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" picks the SDK backend, and each backend validates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attestations against one App Attest environment:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/APIEnvironment","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"App Attest environment","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use for"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/APIEnvironment\/development","type":"reference"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"sandbox","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"locally-signed development builds"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/APIEnvironment\/production","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"production","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TestFlight, App Store, Enterprise"}]}]]],"header":"row","alignments":["left","left","left"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A mismatch — a TestFlight build (production attestation) pointed at","type":"text"},{"typ